WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.338
This query calculates a simple completeness score
Then ROW_NUMBER

00:00:06.364 --> 00:00:11.970
ranks rows inside each normalized duplicate group
The most complete row

00:00:11.983 --> 00:00:17.814
ranks first with signup date and ID used as
additional ordering This

00:00:17.827 --> 00:00:23.480
does not mean the first row is always truly correct
It means the rule

00:00:23.506 --> 00:00:26.440
is explicit reproducible and reviewable
